@startuml
title T&T COMPUTER - Controller, Service và Core
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class Controller {
 #view(view, data, layout): void
 #redirect(path, statusCode): never
}
class Router {
 -routes: array
 +get(path, handler): void
 +post(path, handler): void
 +dispatch(method, uri): void
}
class View {
 +render(view, data, layout): void
}
class Database {
 -connection: ?PDO
 +connection(): PDO
}
class AuthController
class CheckoutController
class PaymentController
class OrderManagementController
class CatalogManagementController
class InventoryController
class PromotionManagementController
class StatisticsController
class SePayPayment {
 -config: array
 +isConfigured(): bool
 +createCheckoutFields(order): array
 +renderCheckoutForm(fields): string
 +amountsMatch(left, right): bool
}
Controller <|-- AuthController
Controller <|-- CheckoutController
Controller <|-- PaymentController
Controller <|-- OrderManagementController
Controller <|-- CatalogManagementController
Controller <|-- InventoryController
Controller <|-- PromotionManagementController
Controller <|-- StatisticsController
Router ..> Controller : dispatch
Controller ..> View
SePayPayment ..> config : config/sepay.php
note bottom: Không có middleware riêng; phân quyền và CSRF được xử lý trong controller.
@enduml
